 R←Test_Table_009(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;Tbl;cells;markdown;newCursorCol
⍝ `FormatTable` preserves the indentation of a table that is part of a list
⍝ R gets one of: 0=Okay, 1=test case failed, ¯1=test case was not executed due to the "batchFlag"
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 Tbl←##.Meddy.Tables
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('  | A | B |' '  |---|---|' '  | 1 | 2 |')0 4
 →T.PassesIf('  |A|B|' '  |-|-|' '  |1|2|')≡markdown
 →T.PassesIf 3 2≡⍴cells

 ⍝ The indentation is taken from the least indented row
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('    | A | B |' '  |---|---|' '   | 1 | 2 |')0 6
 →T.PassesIf('  |A|B|' '  |-|-|' '  |1|2|')≡markdown

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
